From a5e87a5e3290548d8fdf619c74690b20b79a56d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:10:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix mod song loading, story mode order, mouse clicks; drop
 bottom hints

- Load all 13 mod songs: regenerate mods/songs/songs.json, make the
  fetch path relative so it works on the GitHub Pages subpath, and
  emit a "mod" field from server.js
- Story mode plays Bopeebo -> Fresh -> Dad Battle then returns to the
  main menu (fix dropped fade transition + auto-advance on song end)
- Fix mouse clicks on menu buttons (pass game coords to onMouseDown);
  add mouse support to freeplay, options and the pause menu
- Remove the bottom help text in freeplay and options

Co-authored-by: openhands <openhands@all-hands.dev>
